body:
This PR edits GeminiEmbedding to better implement the core BaseEmbedding interface, specifically to use the interface's `batchEmbedding` method to chunk provided nodes into batches of size `embedBatchSize`. As is, GeminiEmbedding sends all nodes in one batch, which results in an error if the batch is of size 100 or greater.

As a side-effect, once #2098 is merged, GeminiEmbedding will include the ability to use `progressCallback`. 

I've added tests (they're maybe a bit excessive for checking that the existing `embedBatchSize` logic is respected -- perhaps most of them should be moved up to test BaseEmbedding?).

**Motivation:**
In the latest LlamaIndexTS, `GeminiEmbedding` implements batch-embedding functionality (and this is used by default in, e.g. vectorstoreindex). However, the Gemini Embedding API supports batches of length 100 or less. The LlamaIndex implementation sends the entire batch in one request, which leads to an error. 

With this slight modification of the [GeminiEmbeddings example](https://github.com/run-llama/LlamaIndexTS/blob/main/examples/models/gemini/embedding.ts),
```
import { GEMINI_EMBEDDING_MODEL, GeminiEmbedding } from "@llamaindex/google";

async function main() {
  if (!process.env.GOOGLE_API_KEY) {
    throw new Error("Please set the GOOGLE_API_KEY environment variable.");
  }
  const embedModel = new GeminiEmbedding({
    model: GEMINI_EMBEDDING_MODEL.EMBEDDING_001,
  });
  const texts = Array.from({ length: 51 }, () => ["hello", "world"]).flat(); // only modification from the existing version, to make the list >100 in length
  const embeddings = await embedModel.getTextEmbeddingsBatch(texts);
  console.log(`\nWe have ${embeddings.length} embeddings`);
}

main().catch(console.error);
```

I get this error:

```
tsx examples/models/gemini/embedding.ts
ApiError: {"error":{"code":400,"message":"* BatchEmbedContentsRequest.requests: at most 100 requests can be in one batch\n","status":"INVALID_ARGUMENT"}}
    at throwErrorIfNotOK (/Users/jeremybmerrill/code/LlamaIndexTS/node_modules/.pnpm/@google+genai@1.8.0_@modelcontextprotocol+sdk@1.13.0_bufferutil@4.0.9/node_modules/@google/genai/dist/node/index.cjs:13330:30)
    at process.processTicksAndRejections (node:internal/process/task_queues:105:5)
    at async /Users/jeremybmerrill/code/LlamaIndexTS/node_modules/.pnpm/@google+genai@1.8.0_@modelcontextprotocol+sdk@1.13.0_bufferutil@4.0.9/node_modules/@google/genai/dist/node/index.cjs:13106:13
    at async Function.getTextEmbeddingsBatch (/Users/jeremybmerrill/code/LlamaIndexTS/packages/providers/google/dist/index.cjs:1825:24)
    at async main (/Users/jeremybmerrill/code/LlamaIndexTS/examples/models/gemini/embedding.ts:11:22) {
  status: 400
}
```

